{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49048","headline":"任阆中下乡检田登艾萧山北望 · 薛光谦","name":"任阆中下乡检田登艾萧山北望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观农巡井邑，长望历山川。\n拥涧开新耨，缘崖指火田。\n荒村无径陌，古戍有风烟。\n瓠叶萦篱长，藤花绕架悬。\n岸高攒树石，水净写云天。\n回首乡关路，行歌犹喟然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛光谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}